/**
 * image.h - Embedded bitmap assets for the Round Display Bitmap example.
 *
 * The Round Display is a full-color 240x240 TFT (GC9A01), so RGB565 pixels
 * render as-is - NO palette quantization (unlike the 6-color Spectra 6
 * ePaper, which snaps every pixel to the nearest of 6 colors).
 *
 * To use your own picture:
 *   1. Open https://javl.github.io/image2cpp/
 *   2. Choose "RGB565 (16-bit)" output, generate, replace gColorWheel_96x96[]
 *      (or add a full 240x240 array and pushImage it at 0,0 - it will clip
 *      to the circular bezel naturally).
 *   3. For a 1-bit logo, keep the default output and use drawBitmap().
 */
